@@ -122,3 +122,9 @@ and application lifetime qualification remain necessary.
 Remaining qualification includes mip/slice preservation and
 resource cleanup under failure, WindowServer, guest restart and a matched
 TestUFO performance comparison.
+
+An explicitly armed diagnostic client can read the last resource request made
+by the same owning task, with its return status and a 512-byte bound. Arming
+clears the record; reading disables recording. Nothing is published to the
+registry or collected from other tasks. This isolates authored heap probes
+without relying on interposition inside the dyld shared cache.
